Scoped inflate neighbour filter

The inflate kernel, the mirrored left/right border tables (coordinateslb,
coordinatesrb), the clamped top/bottom rows, the threshold-zero plane copy,
the plane geometry and the pixel format list in src/video-ops/inflate.ts follow
libavfilter/vf_neighbor.c (inflate, config_input, filter_slice, filter_frame,
pix_fmts and the deflate_inflate options), with the AV_OPT_TYPE_INT expression,
range and rounding semantics of libavutil/opt.c (set_string_number, write_number).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
